{"steam_appid":2999500,"steam_name":"STUNTBOOST","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2999500/1146081772/4cbe60d15f611e45185e8307bdf57712a3bcee7d/1790066101/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790090713","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257431333/0aa7b98b717f5f98240fa7c6df80b1daac254a42/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790090713","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/4758300c9433c51346c454487ceae287476a717d/ss_4758300c9433c51346c454487ceae287476a717d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790090714","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/b5ff74e0ef0c811d79552974da89aeac04c64fa3/ss_b5ff74e0ef0c811d79552974da89aeac04c64fa3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790090714","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/bef3065ba76175787280705c8fd5f67ad7f7fea1/ss_bef3065ba76175787280705c8fd5f67ad7f7fea1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790090714","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/21477a5f047fbc914bd31d369e78b142d47fe62d/ss_21477a5f047fbc914bd31d369e78b142d47fe62d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790090714","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/63f592cc55ba83ef5cc61afa031f37927f3a8e2f/ss_63f592cc55ba83ef5cc61afa031f37927f3a8e2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790090714"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STUNT BOOST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through cardboard tracks, master your momentum and shave off milliseconds to earn medals and challenge friends on a fingerboard with no speed limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/862a3ae678f837a7b4af61a627b1939a.webp?t=1790090714\" width=1 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/a86dcf0aa800558780c73e7e04854062.poster.avif?t=1790090714\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/a86dcf0aa800558780c73e7e04854062.webm?t=1790090714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race through skate-infused parcours as fast as possible!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay and perfect your runs to earn medals, unlocking more rooms in your home featuring new levels and abilities.</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1790090714\" width=1 height=32 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/035cdf42b61313b5a71d885282686139.poster.avif?t=1790090714\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/035cdf42b61313b5a71d885282686139.webm?t=1790090714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb <strong>online leaderboards</strong> for each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your friends' scores to challenge them.</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1790090714\" width=1 height=32 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/3f06c392ae6b7a59a2601c92a3b39594.poster.avif?t=1790090714\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/3f06c392ae6b7a59a2601c92a3b39594.webm?t=1790090714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform big leaps, grinds and flips to boost through childhood memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control gravity to dive mid-air or dash downhill.</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1790090714\" width=1 height=32 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/eb63b65b5d2427d69c86304899f7dc66.poster.avif?t=1790090714\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/eb63b65b5d2427d69c86304899f7dc66.webm?t=1790090714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and search for shortcuts while finding collectibles along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate as fast as you can manage – There is no speed limit!</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6750, 2.66 GHz | AMD Phenom II X3 720, 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTS 450, 1 GB | AMD Radeon HD 5750, 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Racing"],"developers":["Byting Games"],"publishers":["Byting Games"],"release_date":"Sep 22, 2026"}